      "content": "hey, i'm a social studies teacher and i'm trying to put together a lesson plan for my 7th graders about different political movements throughout history. i want the lesson to help them understand why certain viewpoints are seen as progressive and revolutionary, while others are seen as more regressive or just stubborn. can you help me draft an outline for that?",
